1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:01,680
Before the Roar.

2
00:00:01,680 --> 00:00:02,733
One match.

3
00:00:02,733 --> 00:00:04,550
Every perspective.

4
00:00:05,016 --> 00:00:06,226
Watch the runner.

5
00:00:06,226 --> 00:00:07,722
The defender shifts.

6
00:00:07,722 --> 00:00:09,288
A passing lane opens.

7
00:00:09,288 --> 00:00:11,495
Did that run create the space?

8
00:00:11,495 --> 00:00:12,990
It looks convincing.

9
00:00:12,990 --> 00:00:13,916
Let's check.

10
00:00:14,383 --> 00:00:17,124
A fresh synthetic event starts the investigation.

11
00:00:17,124 --> 00:00:18,523
Scout observes the play.

12
00:00:18,523 --> 00:00:19,586
Guide explains it.

13
00:00:19,586 --> 00:00:23,783
Vector calculates twenty-three point seven metres of forward passing gain.

14
00:00:24,249 --> 00:00:29,050
Then Check asks the difficult question: does the evidence actually support the story?

15
00:00:29,050 --> 00:00:30,914
Host brings the answer together.

16
00:00:30,914 --> 00:00:33,399
Each handoff leaves an inspectable receipt.

17
00:00:33,849 --> 00:00:35,923
Four separate Azure model requests.

18
00:00:35,923 --> 00:00:37,759
One deterministic calculation.

19
00:00:37,759 --> 00:00:43,149
These are recorded execution results, with sources and timings you can inspect in the app.

20
00:00:43,616 --> 00:00:45,243
Now change one observation.

21
00:00:45,243 --> 00:00:49,520
In Truth Lab, the defender's shift falls from thirteen metres to zero.

22
00:00:49,520 --> 00:00:51,569
The passing calculation survives.

23
00:00:51,569 --> 00:00:53,316
The movement claim does not.

24
00:00:53,766 --> 00:00:55,927
The unsupported claim is withdrawn.

25
00:00:55,927 --> 00:00:57,655
The broadcast line changes.

26
00:00:57,655 --> 00:00:59,816
You can see what changed, and why.

27
00:01:00,266 --> 00:01:02,949
That correction reaches Pocket Director too.

28
00:01:02,949 --> 00:01:04,656
A new fan gets the concept.

29
00:01:04,656 --> 00:01:06,912
An analyst gets the tactical detail.

30
00:01:06,912 --> 00:01:07,826
Same evidence.

31
00:01:07,826 --> 00:01:09,716
A different way into the game.

32
00:01:10,166 --> 00:01:17,966
Make the match easier to follow with captions, descriptions, clear language, reduced motion, and optional sound and vibration cues.

33
00:01:18,433 --> 00:01:20,533
Foundry helps evaluate the explanations.

34
00:01:20,533 --> 00:01:24,733
The early comparison is narrow, and we publish that limit alongside the result.

35
00:01:25,199 --> 00:01:27,779
Azure Container Apps runs the experience.

36
00:01:27,779 --> 00:01:30,421
Managed identity protects service access.

37
00:01:30,421 --> 00:01:32,749
Blob Storage preserves the evidence.

38
00:01:33,199 --> 00:01:34,423
Before the Roar.

39
00:01:34,423 --> 00:01:35,723
Follow the play.

40
00:01:35,723 --> 00:01:37,252
Question the story.

41
00:01:37,252 --> 00:01:38,399
See the proof.
